Source: zionos-system
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ZionOS Developers <zionos-devel@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), librsvg2-bin, fonts-dejavu-core
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: zionos-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: ZionOS release identification
 Provides /etc/os-release, login banners and dpkg vendor information
 identifying the system as ZionOS, a Debian-based distribution. The original
 Debian files are preserved through dpkg diversions.

Package: zionos-artwork
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: ZionOS logos, wallpapers and boot artwork
 Original ZionOS artwork: logo icons, the default desktop wallpaper and the
 boot menu background.

Package: zionos-desktop-settings
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, zionos-artwork, locales
Description: ZionOS desktop defaults
 System-wide defaults for the ZionOS KDE Plasma desktop: English and Hebrew
 keyboard layouts with Alt+Shift switching, generated en_US and he_IL
 locales, the default wallpaper, the login screen background and the boot
 menu appearance. All of these are defaults that users can change.

Package: zionos-calamares-settings
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, calamares, calamares-settings-debian, zionos-artwork
Description: ZionOS branding for the Calamares installer
 Branding (name, logo, colours, slideshow) and the "Install ZionOS" launcher
 for the Calamares installer used on the ZionOS live image. The installation
 logic itself comes unmodified from calamares-settings-debian.

Package: zionos-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: ZionOS archive key and APT source
 The public key that authenticates the ZionOS package repository, the APT
 source entry that uses it (Signed-By, so the key is trusted for this
 repository only), and an APT pin restricting that repository to zionos-*
 packages.
